- * navigation and language switches.
+ * Single owner of `document.title`. It is this product's own name — not the name of the project the code is
+ * built on, which every route used to say, nor a title derived from the route, which is a desktop habit the
+ * phone has no window chrome for. One place writes it, so it stays right across navigation and language
